WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Layout: Rotate the selected shape and round its corners with the Layout controls.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Appearance: Add a stroke, inspect stroke options, and change the fill to a gradient.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Typography: Adjust the headline spacing and explore OpenType features.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Reshape: Enter Warp mesh and drag a real cage handle to reshape the artwork.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Effects: Add a drop shadow in the native Effects panel.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Trace: Inspect tracing options and the Ignore white setting.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Layers: Compare Multiply and Normal blend modes on the artwork layer.
